silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#icechunkchunkmittens silm:hasLongDescription "The IcechunkChunkMittens is the specific Icechunk chunk c-0x7f4a that stores the Tartu vet-record payload for Mittens, dated 2026-05-18. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'GraniteRow_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#storagelegarrow a owl:NamedIndividual ;
