silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#storagelegarrow silm:hasLongDescription "The StorageLegArrow is the storage-leg morphism sigma: GraniteRow_Mittens -> Mittens, the typed arrow from the chunk manifest to the governed apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'sigma', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
