silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#materializationarrowmittens silm:hasLongDescription "The MaterializationArrowMittens is the materialization morphism mu_Mittens: Mittens -> ChunkManifest_Mittens, mapping the apex to its storage node. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'mu_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
